      "content": "look i hear you but i'm literally just sitting here on my couch and i feel fine besides the itching. i'm just really worried about the cost of the hospital and i really dont want to call 911 for what might just be a tiny reaction. if i take a stronger dose like 4 benadryl at once, would that be enough to stop the swelling from getting worse? i just need to know if i can handle this myself so i can stop worrying about it.",
